        "description": "First-degree relative with BOR syndrome",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of at least three major criteria or two major plus two minor criteria",
    "notes": "Genetic testing for EYA1, SIX1, or SIX5 mutations can support diagnosis"
